    <div class="dv-opt" id="19b" style="width:660px;max-width:660px">
      <div class="dv-olabel"><a class="dv-oid" href="#19b">19b</a><b>2 &middot; Printers column becomes the conversation panel</b>&nbsp;&middot; the Prepare panel, on Home</div>
      <div class="dv-card"><div class="wf">
        <div class="wf-bar"><span class="wf-brand">ORCA</span><span style="margin-left:10px;font-family:'Kalam',cursive;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;color:#8a8578">Home</span></div>
        <div class="wf-body">
          <div style="flex:1;padding:13px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px">
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px"><span class="k">PROJECTS</span><span style="margin-left:auto;background:#ec3013;color:#fff;font-family:'Kalam',cursive;font-weight:700;font-size:10px;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:5px">+ New</span></div>
            <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px">
              <div class="pj"><div class="th"></div><div class="tx"><b>Garage bracket</b><span>Sliced</span></div></div>
              <div class="pj"><div class="th"></div><div class="tx"><b>Phone stand</b><span>Setting up</span></div></div>
              <div class="pj"><div class="th"></div><div class="tx"><b>Cable clips &times;6</b><span>Draft</span></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="dlg" style="width:250px;border:0;border-left:1.5px solid #ddd8cd;box-shadow:none;background:#f6f3ee" data-comment-anchor="33a26a003d-div">
            <div class="dlg-h"><span style="color:#8a8578;font-size:11px">&lsaquo;</span><b data-comment-anchor="b125547bd1-b">Printers</b><span class="sw">Set it up myself</span></div>
            <div class="pin"><div class="pin-k">PRINTER</div>
              <div class="kv"><span class="lk">Printer</span><span class="lv">Bambu Lab A1 Combo</span></div>
              <div class="kv"><span class="lk">Nozzle</span><span class="lv" style="color:#c0361a">0.6 mm &middot; changed</span></div>
              <div class="kv"><span class="lk">Plate</span><span class="lv as">Textured PEI</span></div>
              <div class="kv"><span class="lk">Filament</span><span class="lv">AMS &middot; 4 slots</span></div></div>
            <div class="thr">
              <div class="abub" data-comment-anchor="50a09bd1b0-div">This is the A1 Combo. Tell me what changed on it, or ask anything about it: nozzle, plate, spools, connection. A photo of the part works too.</div>
              <div class="ubub" data-comment-anchor="cf9711013b-div">i put a 0.6 nozzle on it</div>
              <div class="abub">Changed to 0.6 mm. Your two projects on this printer will re-slice with it next time you open them. With 0.6 you can also print thicker layers.</div>
              <div class="opts"><span class="opt def" data-comment-anchor="dc15afb1e8-span">Use 0.3 mm layers</span><span class="opt">Keep 0.2 mm</span><span class="hint">or just type</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="inp" style="padding-left:5px"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;border:1.3px solid #cfc9bd;border-radius:4px;padding:3px 7px;font-size:9px;color:#4a463f;background:#fff;flex:none;margin-right:6px"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#4a463f" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M23 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4l2-3h6l2 3h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="4"/></svg>Photo</span>e.g. &ldquo;I swapped the plate&rdquo; or &ldquo;is it connected?&rdquo;</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="wf-note" style="left:14px;bottom:14px;max-width:230px">the printers column swaps for the conversation panel; &lsaquo; Printers goes back to the list. every opening is a NEW session that starts with the agent saying what it can do here; no history carried over</div>
      </div></div>
      <div class="dv-cap" style="max-width:660px">Add and Change are the same column: &ldquo;+ Add printer&rdquo; and a printer card both open a fresh session, opened by the agent (what this is, what you can ask). Chips are specific actions, never bare Yes/No, with the open input always beneath them. <b>For:</b> identical shape to Prepare; the projects stay in view. <b>Against:</b> 250px is tight for cards and pictures, and while you talk the printer list is hidden.</div>
    </div>


